WEBVTT

00:02:29.371 --> 00:02:30.996
will be worth less tomorrow,

00:02:30.996 --> 00:02:33.704
inciting you to spend it
as soon as possible.

00:02:33.704 --> 00:02:36.079
So although that would revive the trade,

00:02:36.079 --> 00:02:38.329
it would also promote overconsumption,

00:02:38.329 --> 00:02:40.954
or the storage of goods,
like food or gasoline,

00:02:40.954 --> 00:02:42.413
increasing their price,

00:02:42.413 --> 00:02:45.913
leading to a shortage of
consumers and more inflation.

00:02:45.913 --> 00:02:49.163
But deflation would give people
the desire to keep their money,

00:02:49.163 --> 00:02:52.329
and a decrease in consumption
would reduce corporate profits,

00:02:52.329 --> 00:02:53.913
causing more unemployment,

00:02:53.913 --> 00:02:56.079
and a reduction
higher expenses,

00:02:56.079 --> 00:02:58.163
leading the economy
to contract more.

